## Note on provenance

Riptide is a clean-room reimplementation. It contains no code from Internet Download
Manager, which is proprietary software by Tonec FZE. The behavioural design was derived
from static analysis of publicly distributed binaries that the author had installed, and
that analysis is documented in `docs/IDM-REVERSE-ENGINEERING.md` so the derivation can be
checked.

"Internet Download Manager" and "IDM" are trademarks of Tonec FZE. Riptide is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from Tonec's source code.
